# Project TITAN — Official Architecture (PRIMARY)

**Lock:** 2026-07-04 · **V1.2 Primary:** `docs/TITAN_V12_OFFICIAL_ARCHITECTURE.md` · `src/config/titanV12OfficialArchitecture.js`  
**Parent SSoT:** `src/config/titanOfficialArchitecture.js` · `docs/TITAN_OFFICIAL_ARCHITECTURE.md`

## Identity

**Project TITAN** = QMS + Smart Factory Lite + Mobile + QR + Future NFC + MES Ready — 통합 업무 플랫폼

## Philosophy

> *"기존 업무를 없애는 시스템이 아니라 기존 업무를 더 편하게 만드는 시스템"*

- Paper Workflow **유지** · Smart Workflow **추가** · 사용자 Paper OR Smart 선택
- **One Time Input → One Scan → One Workflow**

## Development Priority (Mandatory)

```text
Workflow → UI → Database → 개발 → 테스트 → 현장 피드백 → 개선
```

**Workflow > UI** — 업무 흐름 확정 후 화면 · DB · 구현

## One Time Input Data Flow

```text
제품관리 → 입고 → 생산 → 검사 → 성적서 → 출고 → 통계
```

중복 입력 ❌ · Master Data 적극 활용

## Support Modes (Parallel · Never Delete Paper)

| Mode | Rule |
|------|------|
| **Paper** | HTL · OUT · INV · DPR 출력 **삭제 금지** |
| **Smart (QR)** | Smart Access ID → 기존 화면 deep link |
| **NFC (Future)** | QR와 **동일 Smart Access ID** · Handler 공유 |

## Workflows

**Paper:** 입고 → 입고리스트 출력 → 생산 → 검사 → 성적서 → 출고 → 통계

**Smart:** QR/NFC → 설비/위치 인식 → 공정 → 생산 가능 목록 → LOT → 생산중 → 생산완료 → 검사대기 → 검사 → 성적서 → 출고

## Smart Access ID (Canonical)

| ID | Screen |
|----|--------|
| `NDK://INCOMING` | 입고등록 |
| `NDK://OUTGOING` | 출고등록 |
| `NDK://INSPECTION` | 검사등록 |
| `NDK://CERTIFICATE` | 성적서관리 |
| `NDK://EQ/{code}` | 설비 (ION-01 · ION-02 · GAS-01 · SOFT-01) |

**Legacy alias:** `NDK|EQ|{code}` · `NDK|IN|REG` etc. — backward compat in `equipmentQr.js` · `parseSmartAccessId()`

**Route mapping:** `src/config/smartAccessArchitecture.js` → `SMART_ACCESS_TARGETS`

## Equipment QR Rules

- NOT per product · NOT per LOT
- **ONE QR per equipment** · multi-copy print OK
- Official codes: ION-01 · ION-02 · GAS-01 · SOFT-01

## V1.2 Pillars (Consolidated)

### Menu (§1) — Menu Simple, Function Deep
11 core + 경리·회계 module-gated · `titanV12MenuArchitecture.js`

### Module System (§2) — ON/OFF · data retained
`/environment/modules` · OFF = hide menu · HOME · permissions · `titanV12ModuleExpansion.js`

### Storage (§6–§8) — SQLite meta + Storage files
- **SQLite:** metadata only (path · name · date · user · revision) — **no file blobs**
- **Storage folders:** Certificate · Shipment · Inspection · Drawing · Image · Document · Backup
- **Location:** configurable (local → server → NAS → cloud) — path change only
- **Manager:** `/environment/storage` — usage · optimize · backup · restore

### Company Assets (§11)
All files managed inside TITAN — Windows folder direct access ❌

### HOME (§12)
Program entry — quick menus · recent work · QR · KPI · **금일 업무** · module-aware widgets

### Final Goal (§14)
MES **does NOT replace** · Before MES = factory ops · After MES = QMS + DMS + Smart Access + 경리 + 회계 platform

## MES Ready

- TITAN **does NOT replace MES**
- Current: SessionStorage → TITAN · Future: MES → SQLite/API → TITAN
- **UI·Workflow 불변** — Repository/Data Source만 교체

## Development Principles (10 Rules — Lock)

1. 기존 디자인 임의 변경 금지
2. 기존 기능 삭제 금지
3. Workflow 중심 개발
4. 클릭 최소화
5. One Time Input
6. Paper + Smart 병행
7. QR + NFC Ready
8. Master Data 적극 활용
9. 빌드 성공 후 보고
10. Commit 가능한 상태 유지

